<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the</p>
<p>Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
